<title>JAPAN: Nissin to issue 470 mln yen warrant bonds.</title>
<headline>Nissin to issue 470 mln yen warrant bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Nissin Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities</p>
<p> TYPE domestic warrant  ISSUE NO  2	   AMT   470 million yen</p>
<p> COUPON  1.4 pct	  ISS PRICE 100 yen   MATURITY 29.Mar.99</p>
<p> EXERCISE FRM 1.May.97  EXERCISE TO 26.Mar.99</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 28.Mar.97  INT PAY 29.Mar/Sept</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 12-27 Mar</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
</text>
